--------------------
Behaviour was implemented from public documentation and from source that is
compatible with the GPLv2:

  Pan Docs                    CC0        Game Boy / Game Boy Color hardware
                                         reference (registers, timing, tile
                                         maps, OAM, palettes, power-up state)
  ares (ares/gb, sm83)        ISC        Game Boy Color behaviour
  SameBoy (Core, BootROMs)    MIT        edge cases and the free CGB boot ROM
  gambatte (libgambatte and   GPL-2.0    CGB timing model (speed switch, HDMA,
